  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 101.06 “Board” means “board” as defined in RSA 12-G:2, VI, namely, “the board of directors of the authority.”\n\nSource. #7847, eff 3-8-03; ss by # 8146, eff 8-28-04; renumbered by #8298 (from Pda 101.05); ss and moved by #8760, eff 11-18-06 (from Pda 101.04)",
